      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "Born here. Raised here. Processed here.\n\nThat’s what Product of the USA means.\n\nAmericans deserve to know where their food comes from—and they deserve the choice to support the farmers and ranchers who grow, raise, and process food right here at home.\n\nA transparent food supply helps families make informed choices, strengthens confidence in our food system, and helps build a healthier, stronger nation.\n\nFarm security is national security. 🇺🇸\n\nGreat to be in Minnesota for Farmfest. Thank you to @RobOlsonFox9 and @fox9 for a great discussion about how the Trump Administration is fighting for the American farmer AND the American family! 💪🇺🇸🚜",
      "text_resolved": "Born here. Raised here. Processed here.\n\nThat’s what Product of the USA means.\n\nAmericans deserve to know where their food comes from—and they deserve the choice to support the farmers and ranchers who grow, raise, and process food right here at home.\n\nA transparent food supply helps families make informed choices, strengthens confidence in our food system, and helps build a healthier, stronger nation.\n\nFarm security is national security. 🇺🇸\n\nGreat to be in Minnesota for Farmfest. Thank you to @RobOlsonFox9 and @fox9 for a great discussion about how the Trump Administration is fighting for the American farmer AND the American family! 💪🇺🇸🚜",
