      "text": "Just spoke with Kevin McDaniel, who owns 14 Piggly Wiggly Food for Less stores across Florida, Georgia, and Alabama.\n\nKevin is boldly stepping up to lower costs for families. His model is simple: When costs go down, prices go down.\n\nThrough Cost Plus 10% pricing and the Power Buy Program, 100% of manufacturer promotional funding is passed directly to customers. Lowering prices on fresh beef, pork, and poultry.\n\nThank you, Kevin, for answering President Trump’s call and putting American families FIRST! 🇺🇸",
