      "text": "Another major grocer is stepping up to help lower food prices for American families.\n\n@meijer is lowering prices on more than 1,000 grocery and household items, from fresh meat like ground beef to fresh produce and other everyday essentials.\n\nWith fresh food purchases increasing 7.5% in just the first year of the Trump Administration, it’s more important than ever to ensure fresh food is affordable for American consumers.\n\nThank you, Meijer, for answering the call to help lower food prices for American consumers. GRATEFUL! \n\n⬇️⬇️⬇️\nhttps://t.co/OZxMqNt3ZI",
