      "text": "Thanks to President Trump’s pro-growth, America First economic policies, we’re beginning to see real progress on affordability.\n\nCompanies like C&S Wholesale Grocers, Walmart, Sam’s Club, Giant Eagle, and others are lowering prices at hundreds of stores across the country.\n\nOver the last several months, we’ve been working directly with grocers, retailers, and wholesalers to expand access to fresh, healthy, affordable food for American families.\n\nThere’s more work to do, but this is another step in the right direction.\n\n@RapidResponse47",
